{
  "caveats": [
    "All candidates includes school candidates; the two groups must not be added. O/L attendance covers candidates sitting five or more subjects. University qualification is examination eligibility, not an offer, admission or enrolment. The source labels examination years without specifying actual sitting dates or tracking individual cohorts. Annual O/L and A/L counts do not form a student transition series, and two reported years do not establish a long-term trend. Results are national, with no district or school detail.",
    "The source uses .. for unavailable figures and a dash for nil or negligible. Both retain their printed token and a distinct status; neither is converted to an exact zero."
  ],
