    "Department of Examinations figures for 2024 and 2025. O/L records candidates who sat at least five subjects and the percentage qualifying for A/L. A/L records candidates who sat, the number qualifying for university and their qualification percentage, with an additional applied count for all candidates. School candidates and all candidates remain separate populations."
